nodes.prompt:
List the files in "$ARTIFACTS_DIR" and write a short "$ARTIFACTS_DIR/README.md" with:
- Title: Edit and upscale
- Source image URL: {{inputs.image_url}}
- Original instruction: {{inputs.instruction}}
- Edit prompt sent and model used (fal-ai/flux-pro/kontext)
- Upscale model (fal-ai/esrgan), scale and before/after sizes
- A table of files (the before.* original, edited.png, edited-upscaled.png) with one line each on what it is; mark any that are missing.
Never include API keys. Reply with the README contents.

Edit step:
{{edit.output}}

Upscale step:
{{upscale.output}}
